// Shrike Coupe body: a mid-90s twin-rotor sports coupe.
//
// Intent: small, low and all curves. A short rounded nose with pop-up lamps over a small
// mouth, a bubble cabin set well back, a long curved rear window over a hatch, hips that
// swell over the rear wheels, a full-width tail lamp strip and a fixed wing on the deck.
// Five-spoke alloys, black trim. Front engine set back, rear drive. Generic period cues
// only.
//
